  "readme": "CSS Vars for split words, chars & more! Splitting.js is a JavaScript microlibrary designed to split (section off) an element in a variety of ways, such as words, characters, child nodes, and more! Most Splitting methods utilize a series of <span>s populated with CSS variables and data attributes unlocking transitions and animations that were previously not feasible with CSS. Install with npm i splitting -s or Download. Consult the guide & documentation for more details and installation instructions. Guide & Documentation Demos Maintainers Maintainer GitHub Twitter Stephen Shaw @shshaw @shshaw Christopher Wallis @notoriousb1t @notoriousb1t",
